# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Localization
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Raw XTM translation memory (~97 MB source file). Kept on disk under
# localization/sources/ for reference and term mining, but never committed —
# term-level pairs are extracted into localization/glossary/ja.csv instead.
localization/sources/JA-XTM-TM.csv
# Per-run snapshots of the localize skill's raw output, used by the
# localization-retrospective skill to diff against human-corrected merged PRs.
localization/retrospective/.snapshots/
